		{
			title: "Cooking Ingredients?"
			x: -8.25d
			y: 0.5625d
			shape: "gear"
			description: [
				"&dIf you've seen the original version of Vault Hunters 3, Bandit, you might be a little confused as to why the Scavenger items are all...food items."
				""
				"&5Before they were stuff like amulets, blood vials, parchments, etc. But my sis and I decided to...change things a bit for you."
				""
				"&dI shifted what items were considered 'Scavenger Drops' to a bunch of special food ingredients. This is so you can use them better outside the vault."
				""
				"&5See, normally when you leave a Vault, all the scav item are deleted. Used to be they became [Rotten] and you could break them down for Soul Shards."
				""
				"&dAnd these 'Vault Ingredients' are another key to cracking open the system. You'll need these to create Vault Food, which you can find out more about in the Research section of the Q.U.E.S.T. Tablet."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["1881243BF68F0FAC"]
			size: 0.75d
			id: "6A45494E0B112308"
			tasks: [{
				id: "32825A31A93C868B"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Emberstone Gear"
			icon: {
