			x: -7.25d
			y: 2.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&dOne thing you'll start finding in Living Chests, Bandit, are Inscriptions and Inscription Pieces. Full Inscriptions will either be a basic Common Room, or one of the special Vault Rooms."
				""
				"&5Inscriptions can be added to your Vault Crystal (using a Crystal Workbench). If it isn't a Common Room, this will guarantee the room on the Inscription spawns in that Vault."
				""
				"&dWhen you enter the Vault, the Portal Room will have a map built into the floor. The different block in the center is your Portal Room. Each block around it is a room."
				""
				"&5That be a treasure map, Bandit. Showing ya to yer plunder, of course."
				""
				"&dOh yeah, we've snuck in a new kind of Box to the FOPGame Server loot pool : Inscription Boxes."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
