		{
			title: "Death In Spirit"
			x: -10.0d
			y: 0.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Body Recovery"
			description: [
				"&dIf you've died in a Vault after hitting level 20, Bandit, no doubt you've found most of your inventory missing and a ghost body spawning where you spawned as well."
				""
				"&5That's yer spirit, Bandit, and if ye want yer inventory back, you'll be wanting to make a Spirit Extractor."
				""
				"&dYou can put your spirit/ghost/body onto a Spirit Extractor, then pay the listed Vault Gold to get your item's back."
				""
				"&5The FOP determine yer body's cost by your equipment, how many bags you have on you, and a few other things."
				""
				"&dIf you don't have enough Vault Gold, you can still retrieve your items, but you will go into debt with The Locker."
				""
				"&5Hm, an odd play on Davy Jones Locker, eh? Well, the Locker will apply to all future Vaults ye make until the Debt is paid. Ye won't gain any experience in Vaults with The Locker."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["1881243BF68F0FAC"]
			id: "5A04F0E50CF5F17F"
			tasks: [{
				id: "77F0C183D71F09FA"
				type: "item"
				item: "the_vault:spirit_extractor"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "60B3745CD09CE8C8"
				type: "choice"
				exclude_from_claim_all: true
				table_id: 5632731352558517809L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Baubles n' Trinkets"
			x: -4.75d
			y: 1.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Accessorize with Power"
			description: [
				"&dA new piece of equipment that'll start showing up, albeit very rarely, is Vault Trinkets"
				""
				"&5Sorta like magic rings or amulets, Bandit. They give some sort of bonus or power in the Vaults when worn."
				""
				"&5They are sorted into three colors : Blue, Red, and Green. To equip them, you'll need a Vault Trinket Pouch."
				""
				"&5And note they have limited uses, Bandit. Each time you enter a Vault with one, it consumes a use."
				""
				"&dThough many of them are useful outside of the vault too. That double jump one for example, or the wall climbing one."
				""
				"&5Here ye go, we snuck an extra one out for ye. A test, but also a reward."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["2EC8B80AE1A271D5"]
