		{
			title: "Loot n' Plunder"
			x: -6.75d
			y: -2.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "An Experience All It's Own"
			description: [
				"&dIf you are finding yourself outpacing your equipment a bit too fast, Bandit, you can make a Plunderer's Vault Rock."
				""
				"&5Ye use it on a Vault Altar like a normal Vault Rock, and pay the price to turn it into a special Vault Crystal."
				""
				"&dThis one can't be modified further, but the Plunder modifier changes a few things. First off, you get almost no experience in the Vault. Small things might give a bit of XP, but nowhere even close to what you would normally get."
				""
				"&5It also boosts the loot ye can find. A bit more loot in the chests, and a bigger percentage of Vault Ores being in Mining POIs and rooms."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["2EC8B80AE1A271D5"]
			id: "731864D511892F56"
			tasks: [{
