			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Magic in the Air"
			description: [
				"&dBandit, with all these special Capstones, I want to try something. I've whipped up a new Capstone for you to try : the Enchanted Capstone. I've seeded it into Dungeon loot, so keep an eye open."
				""
				"&5What's that one do, sis?"
				""
				"&dSo, sometimes when you start a Vault, you'll see some special modifiers activate. Like the Raw Vaults always have specific modifiers, for example. I think I can hook into that system for some... shenanigans."
				""
				"&5Uh oh, she said Shenanigans. Be careful, Bandit."
				""
				"&dNot wrong, I'm not sure how the system will handle this. With the Enchanted Capstone, it'll add a custom modifier: Enchanted. Every so often some sort of event will happen while you run that Vault. If this works, I have an idea brewing..."
			]
