			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "One For Each God"
			description: [
				"&dWith the God Capstones, I think we can shift a few things to create a special Vault for each God."
				""
				"&5This should help ye gain Reputation with specific Gods faster, to build out yer Divine Paradox better."
				""
				"&dSo, make one of these four special God items, and put them onto your Vault Altar like any other Vault Rock. Completing the Vault Crystal will get you a special Zealot Vault."
				""
				"&5The whole Vault will be themed to that God, and all God Altars ye find will be for that God only."
			]
