			description: [
				"&dOnce you start collecting Trinkets, Bandit, you'll eventually find ones you have no use for."
				""
				"&5Aye, and ones ye already have and don't need."
				""
				"&dYou can recycle these Trinkets in a Vault Recycler, and you'll usually get back Vault Trinket Scrap."
				""
				"&5Bring 'em to this Vault Trinket Forge, and combined with some other materials, ye can forge a new Trinket from the ones ye've already unlocked."
