			description: [
				"&5In the FOP Game Server, Trinkets require ye to wear a Trinket Pouch to equip them."
				""
				"&dThe starter Trinket Pouch enables you to equip one Blue and one Red trinket. You can find other Trinket Pouches as loot or other ways, and they can let you equip Green color trinkets, or two of the same color Trinket, or more than 2 Trinkets."
				""
				"&5As well, Bandit, ye can remove a Trinket Pouch and it will keep the Trinkets ye put into it, enabling ye to swap in and out sets of Trinkets for different builds."
