				"&5Vault Fruit enables ye to add time to yer Vault Timer, to help eek out just a bit more loot or enough time to finish the Objective."
				""
				"&dEach Vault Fruit you consume takes 10% of your max HP. "
				""
				"&5Ye'll find bigger and better Fruit the higher ye level up. Some of them have special side effects as well."
				""
