			subtitle: "Ignore The Scuff Marks"
			description: [
				"&5As you level higher, you will slow down in gaining levels, but increase the amount of equipment you find in a Vault."
				""
				"&5Eventually you'll find a piece of equipment that should last you long enough that you wear down the Durability to the breaking point."
				""
				"&5If you still have a piece of Gear you want to use longer when the Durability runs out, you'll want a Repair Core."
				""
				"&5Combine a Repair Core with the piece of equipment in an Anvil to repair it. It will consume a Repair slot on the equipment and refill the Durability."
