			description: [
				"&5Are ye playing on a server with other Assistants? Have one of ye found that ultra rare transmog that everyone else wants?"
				""
				"&dThen you want to make the &lTransmog Brew! &r&dWith this, the person who crafts it can share the Transmogs they've unlocked with someone else!"
				""
				"&5Keep in mind, this does not include special transmogs, such as those unlocked for God Reputation, special unlock conditions, etc."
