		{
			title: "BOSS BATTLE!"
			x: -2.75d
			y: 0.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Neighborhood or a City Boss?"
			description: [
				"&5At 50 there is another more normal Vault type that unlocks: Hunt the Runes."
				""
				"&5These ones are a bit more difficult, as you will be fighting a big Boss type enemy. But to summon this boss, you'll need to find Runes."
				""
				"&5Runes'll occasionally spawn in chests, and you'll need at least 5 of them to summon the boss. Each rune will modify the boss's health, damage, and how often they use their abilities; as well as adding a reward."
				""
				"&5You can add more than 5 runes to increase the rewards, but keep in mind that at 20, 40, and 60 runes the Boss will get extra special abilities."
				""
				"&5You can get a good selection of Runes to build up the Boss how you want. Just take the Runes back to the first room, put them in the Pedestal, and then kill the boss. Easy peasy."
			]
			dependencies: ["1799D40CDE8D8F82"]
			hide: true
			id: "6CB7D3FCD65922FC"
			tasks: [{
				id: "552282F2443A2B05"
